    {
      "id": "3.65.8",
      "label": "3.65.8",
      "numbers": [
        8
      ],
      "devanagari": "एकस्य तु विमर्दो अयम् न द्वयोः वदताम् वर\nन हि वृत्तम् हि पश्यामि बलस्य महतः पदम् |",
      "iast": "ekasya tu vimardo ayam na dvayoḥ vadatām vara\nna hi vṛttam hi paśyāmi balasya mahataḥ padam |",
      "translation": "\"This is just a solo-combatant's combat but not among duo, oh, best articulator one among best articulators, I indeed observe that no huge army is eventuated here, nor its stamp...",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "vadataam vara",
          "iast": "vadatām vara",
          "devanagari": "वदतां वर",
          "meaning": "oh, among articulators, the best",
