      "label": "3.65.12",
      "numbers": [
        12
      ],
      "devanagari": "येन राजन् हृता सीता तम् अन्वेषितुम् अर्हसि\nमद् द्वितीयो धनुष् पाणिः सहायैः परम ऋषिभिः |",
      "iast": "yena rājan hṛtā sītā tam anveṣitum arhasi\nmad dvitīyo dhanuṣ pāṇiḥ sahāyaiḥ parama ṛṣibhiḥ |",
      "translation": "\"Oh, king, it will be apt of you to wield your bow and search for him who abducted Seetha, along with me as your squire and standby, and with the help of sublime sages available in this forest...",
